# Determinism: the figures and their CSV intermediate layer are byte-compared by
# verify.sh. `core.autocrlf` must not be allowed to rewrite them on checkout --
# that would make every build "fail" on a Windows clone for no reason.
*.csv   text eol=lf
*.svg   text eol=lf
*.py    text eol=lf
*.sh    text eol=lf
*.md    text eol=lf
SOURCES.sha256 text eol=lf
*.png   binary

# Run artefacts are hashed into runs/<id>/MANIFEST.json, and a digest computed
# over the bytes on this disk is only worth something if a clone gets the same
# bytes. Without these, a manifest written on Windows stops matching the moment
# somebody checks the tree out. (V20, 2026-07-29.)
*.json  text eol=lf
*.log   text eol=lf
*.txt   text eol=lf
*.jsonl text eol=lf

# And this file itself, which was the one exception until it was noticed.
.gitattributes text eol=lf
